+issueNumber: MDL-89890
+notes:
+  mod_forum:
+    - message: >-
+        The `mod_forum/forum_subscription_action` template renders the
+        view/manage subscribers menu with the `core/tertiary_navigation_selector`
+        partial, which handles navigation to the selected option, and the
+        subscription mode menu with `core/url_select`. Plugins overriding this
+        template must use the same context keys (`viewandmanageselect` and
+        `subscriptionoptions`) and partials.
+      type: improved
